{"id":"e48659def4f8","path":"/en/university/info/llm/publications/scientific-articles","lang":"en","title":"Scientific articles","description":"La produzione scientifica rappresenta una componente importante del profilo professionale del personale docente del Laboratorio di lingue moderne. Attraverso la partecipazione a progetti di ricerca e la pubblicazione di contributi specialistici, il corpo docente contribuisce…","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","LLM","Publications"],"image":null,"words":153,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/llm/pubblicazioni/articoli-scientifici","en":"/en/university/info/llm/publications/scientific-articles"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"LLM","path":null},{"label":"Publications","path":null},{"label":"Scientific articles","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>Scientific output is a key component of the professional profile of the academic staff of the Laboratory of Modern Languages. Through their involvement in research projects and the publication of scholarly contributions, the teaching staff contributes to the dissemination of knowledge and to academic debate in the fields of language teaching and learning, and intercultural communication.</p><ul> <li>Criblez, A., &amp; Manzato, T. (2026). Les expressions idiomatiques entre les langues comme approche de la compétence pragmatique et de la diversité linguistique en cours de FLE à l’université au Tessin. <em>Babylonia: Journal of Language Education</em>, <em>1</em>, 18-23. <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.55393/babylonia.v1i.748\">https://doi.org/10.55393/babylonia.v1i.748</a></li> <li>de Fornel, T., &amp; Manzato, T. (2025). L’intercompréhension comme réponse à la mise en danger des langues romanes régionales: regards sociolinguistiques, perspectives didactiques. <em>Revue transatlantique d’études suisses</em>, <em>14</em>, 157-179. <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.7202/1123084ar\">https://doi.org/10.7202/1123084ar</a></li> <li>Stigen Pescia, S. (2015). I corsi di lingua italiana per alloglotti all'Università della Svizzera italiana. <em>Babylonia: Journal of Language Education, 3</em>, 66-69. <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.55393/babylonia.v3i.905\">http://doi.org/10.55393/babylonia.v3i.905</a></li> </ul>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Laboratory of Modern Languages","href":"/en/universita/info/llm"},{"label":"Administrative team","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/administrative-team"},{"label":"Lecturers team","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/lecturers-team"},{"label":"Annual report","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/annual-report"},{"label":"LLM key figures","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/figures"},{"label":"Courses","href":"/en/university/info/llm/italian/courses"},{"label":"Lecturers","href":"/en/universita/info/llm/italiano/docenti"},{"label":"Courses satisfaction","href":"/en/university/info/llm/italian/satisfaction-italian-courses"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/italian-language-courses-faq"},{"label":"Courses","href":"/en/university/info/llm/french/courses"},{"label":"Lecturers","href":"/en/university/info/llm/french/lecturers"},{"label":"Courses satisfaction","href":"/en/university/info/llm/french/satisfaction-french-courses"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/french-language-courses-faq"},{"label":"Courses","href":"/en/university/info/llm/german/courses"},{"label":"Lecturers","href":"/en/university/info/llm/german/lecturers"},{"label":"Courses satisfaction","href":"/en/university/info/llm/german/satisfaction-german-courses"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/german-language-courses-faq"},{"label":"Courses","href":"/en/university/info/llm/courses"},{"label":"Lecturers","href":"/en/university/info/llm/english/lecturers"},{"label":"Courses satisfaction","href":"/en/university/info/llm/engli